; expo.ax - entry for the Axiom port of `expo` v2.0.1.
;
; Black-box port: the reference binary wraps `gh`:
; `gh auth status -h github.com` first, then per-subcommand `gh api` calls.
; delete dry-runs in order; delete --yes, visibility and archive run one
; `gh api` per valid repo through a bounded pool; create runs in order and
; stops on the first InvalidRepository or gh failure. Valid means exactly
; one '/'. Routing: version to stdout, usage and errors to stderr.
(import IO)
(import src.Main)

(:: main Int)
;@axiom:effect(io)
(fn (main)
  (expoMain))
